<main class="min-w-0 flex-1 p-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 pb-24 text-[15px] leading-7 text-gray-700">
        <header>
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">Legal</p>
            <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Last updated November 15, 2026. This covers the hosted site at windcraft.swapniljadhav.com. If you run your own copy of the code, you are the one running that copy, and these pages don't apply to it.</p>
        </header>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">What we collect</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>When you create an account: your name, your email, and a hashed password (we never store the password itself). If you sign in with Google, we receive your name and email from Google, plus a Google account ID, and nothing else. We don't get your Google password or access to your Google data.</p><p>What you make: your projects, designs and pages, and whether you made them public. Public designs in the gallery can be seen by anyone.</p><p>Optional settings: if you turn on AI features, the Anthropic API key or local model address you enter is stored with your account. If you create an API token for the MCP connector, only a hash of it is stored.</p></div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">How it is used</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>To sign you in, keep your work, show public designs in the gallery, and run the features you ask for. We don't sell your data and we don't show ads.</p></div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Cookies</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>One session cookie keeps you signed in. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.</p></div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Who else handles it</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>The site runs on Vercel, and the database is on MongoDB Atlas. Google handles sign-in if you choose it. If you turn on AI features with your own Anthropic key, the text you send to the AI goes to Anthropic under your own key.</p></div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Your choices</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>You can make a design private or delete it at any time. To have your account and its data deleted, open an issue or discussion on <a class="underline" href="https://github.com/Tolaj/windcraft/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> or use the <a class="underline" href="/support">Support</a> page, and we will remove it.</p></div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes</h2>
            <div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><p>If this changes in a way that matters, we will update the date above.</p></div>
        </section>

    </div>
</main>
